## SQ-CC12-01 | Common 1.2.0 with its optional mods only: no mixin or class error, swap summary with capability keys
@group B (Common only)
@commands SQ-CCO-01 on the 1.2.0 jar (`@modset cc_only full`; was `cc_only_srv.sh` full set with the 1.2.0 jar)
@pass as SQ-CCO-01; also `[swaps] ... capability key(s)` in the list summary line, no error naming `ChatOpen`, `SwapReport` or `SwapCapabilityKeys`; on stop `[swaps] load report: every listed id resolved`
@fails new mixin SRG names (`m_188230_`, `m_41712_`, `m_91326_`, `m_90893_`, `m_90889_`); a client mixin loaded on the dedicated server
@from batches/r1114cc12/cc12_01.qb
@modset cc_only full
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|outside the tested range|^(?!.*Error loading class).*(ClassNotFoundException|NoClassDefFoundError)
bootreject (creativecompat|creativecalendar|creativeengineering|creativeequipment|creativemagic|creativedelight|creativebrewing)(?!:)
bootreject (?i)(ChatOpen|SwapReport|SwapCapabilityKeys).*(error|exception|fail)
bootreject (?i)(m_188230_|m_41712_|m_91326_|m_90893_|m_90889_).*(error|fail|not found|could not)
bootexpect \[perf\] Immersive Weathering callTick handler .* now calls IwGrowthFast\.blockTick
bootexpect \[compat\] Immersive Portals overwrites conform to target visibility
bootexpect \[swaps\] \d+ list file\(s\): .* \d+ capability key\(s\)
# judge-cc r1122cc (2026-11-22): the scratch creativedevtools jar's own create/ scripts error on recipe types this set lacks (same filter as CCO.qb line 37); bootreject above ignores the (?!:) ids in the default idleRandomTickRules list
kjsreject ^(?!.*creativedevtools:kubejs/create/).*(?i:error)
shell ls mods | grep -i creative; grep -m1 -E "\[swaps\] [0-9]+ list file" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-260; grep -c "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log; grep -cE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log; true
shell grep -iE "mixin.*(client|Minecraft|Screen|ChatScreen)" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "creativecommon" | grep -viE "skipp|not loaded|dist" | head -5; true
look mods: creativecommon-1.2.0 only; swap summary with capability keys; Common startup files loaded, 0 startup errors; no client mixin applied on the server

## SQ-CC12-02 | Common + Compat + Calendar: boots, reloads, tag scripts skip absent mods
@group B (Common + Compat + Calendar)
@commands SQ-CC-03 on the 1.2.0 jar
@pass as SQ-CC-03; 0 KubeJS errors from `plantabletags.js`, `smokable_tags.js` with their mods absent
@fails dict key of an absent mod not skipped in the tag scripts
@from batches/r1114cc12/cc12_02.qb
@modset cpp_chain compat
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
> reload
sleep 25
kjsreject (?i)error
shell ls mods; test -f config/creativecommon-common.toml && echo "config written"; grep -ciE "error" logs/kubejs/server.log; grep -iE "plantabletags|smokable_tags" logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -iE "error|exception" | head -5; grep -ciE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log; true
look config written; 0 KubeJS errors (server and startup), none from plantabletags.js or smokable_tags.js

## SQ-CC12-03 | full pack on Common 1.2.0: no mixin or class error, startup files loaded, swap aliases installed
@group A (full pack)
@commands SQ-CC-02 with the 1.2.0 jar in place of `mods/creativecommon-1.1.0.jar` (scratch copy, never the instance's `mods/`)
@pass as SQ-CC-02; `[swaps] N permanent alias(es)` with N > 0; no `[swaps] unresolved`
@fails swap list parse (`capabilities` block); alias install before the registry freeze
@from batches/r1114cc12/cc12_03.qb
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootexpect \[swaps\] \d+ permanent alias
bootreject \[swaps\] .*unresolved|\[swaps\] .*had no survivor
shell ls mods | grep -i creativecommon; grep -nE "Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|outside the tested range|ClassNotFoundException|NoClassDefFoundError" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-220 | head -12; echo "---"; grep -m3 -E "\[swaps\] [0-9]+ permanent alias|\[swaps\] [0-9]+ list file" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-240; grep -n "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-200; echo "startup ERROR lines: $(grep -c ERROR logs/kubejs/startup.log)"; true
look no mixin or class error from our jars (third-party optional-class lines named); no out-of-range WARN; Common files loaded; 0 startup ERROR; N permanent aliases N > 0
